      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CANYA AZURE (4) placed last time (30.34) at this track in a Restricted WIN, finishing third and beaten 1.5 lengths. Already a winner from this draw. Looks well placed and should feature. STAND NEAR (1) turned in a better run last time to find a minor placing (30.28) at this track behind Jackpot Junior in a Restricted WIN. Led around the bend before fighting on well and should give a sight. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings three times from four starts. Expected to feature. FARMOR FREEDOM (6) had been going along well winning a Maiden three back then placing at this track before missing the frame latest when fourth (22.25) at Townsville. Key player on best and worth another try. FARMOR MYSTERY (3) finished in the placings last start and deserves some thought.",
